        "original_id": "85dd3361-c0ae-5da7-822f-07ed5fec615c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lauren London, Chris Robinson\n- Works: ATL, 90210, Entourage, The Game\n- Roles: Kiera Whitaker\n- Topics: acting careers, music videos, film and television\n\nFacts:\n- Lauren London was born on December 5, 1984.\n- Lauren London is an American film actress, model, television personality, and occasional television actress.\n- Lauren London began her career appearing in music videos before transitioning into film and television acting.\n- ATL is a 2006 American comedy-drama film.\n- ATL was the feature film directorial debut of music video director Chris Robinson.\n- Lauren London earned recognition for her performance in the 2006 film ATL.\n- Lauren London also earned recognition for her appearances in the television shows 90210 and Entourage.\n- Lauren London played Kiera Whitaker on the BET comedy-drama The Game.",
